ISO-10303-21;
/* N059: B-spline edge bspline_high_curvature with degree-3 cubic and 5 control points; peak curvature near u=0.48 falls between 23 default samples; UpdateEdgeTol underestimates maximum 3D-vs-2D curve deviation */
